2026-07-26T10:39:16.4145041Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T10:39:16.4145903Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T10:39:16.4146709Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
